# Store products — AI must follow

Before creating or changing store products, **read** `STORE-PRODUCT-GUIDE.md` at the project root. Follow it step by step.

## Hard stops

- **Never** change, redirect, or rename `/store/product` (live ads URL).
- **Never** rename slug/contentId `pan-india-leads-2026` unless the user explicitly asks.
- **Never** invent a second Meta Pixel or per-product Razorpay keys.
- **Never** trust browser-sent prices; server price comes from the product file.
- **Never** rewire buy / track / timer / zoom when doing a design change.
- **Never** edit shared UI (`product-hero.tsx`, shared store CSS, shared FAQ/details) “just for one product.”

## How to add a product

1. Copy `src/lib/store/products/_TEMPLATE.ts` → `src/lib/store/products/<slug>.ts`
2. Rename the export; fill all fields; keep `published: false`
3. Put PDF under `private/store/downloads/` and set `download`
4. Register in `src/lib/store/products/index.ts` (`REGISTERED_PRODUCTS`)
5. Test at `/store/product/<slug>`
6. Set `published: true` only when the user asks to put it on the homepage

## Architecture to preserve

- One product = one content file under `src/lib/store/products/`
- Shared Pixel + CAPI; each product uses its own `contentId`
- Shared Razorpay keys (site-wide); per-product `price` in the product file
- Live ads product is served **only** at `/store/product` (slug URL for that product must 404)
- Env `NEXT_PUBLIC_STORE_PRICE_INR` overrides price for the live ads product only
- Legacy purchase slug `poster-pack` must keep mapping to the live ads download

## Design changes for one product

- Copy the section into a **new** component name
- Change look only; keep calling shared buy/track helpers
- Do not build a pre-made `layout` / `faqStyle` config system unless asked
- Product files hold content only — never payment or Pixel code

## Mixed hero reminder

`product-hero.tsx` contains design **and** checkout/tracking wiring. Leaving buy/track lines alone is required. Cutting those wires breaks payments/Meta for that page.

## Done checklist

- [ ] Guide steps followed
- [ ] `/store/product` behavior/URL unchanged
- [ ] New product unpublished until user says publish
- [ ] No new Pixel / no per-product Razorpay secrets
- [ ] No shared-UI edit that affects other products
